    "ACHIEVEMENT_HABIBI_TESLA_BODY_CHARACTERUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_DESCRIPTION": "Riparu Tesla-bobenon per ajna energifonto (Fuel Array, Royal Capacitor, Unstable Tesla Coil, Charged Perforator, Ukulele, Genesis Loop ktp.).",
